    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《愛sńg火》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">藍春瑞&nbsp;</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWIXhMGteeIZw_YfyI6Z-VcJ9i-5-D77th33ioqYVWDqQB233SbjuwdwNW3GZr2ocDYiadi_4hynK0BTSq__1QkY9KKCfOpwhYYTxwcIdi5_pm753aXJi1eYj53f1U94ranmCppulItd-C4CFOgXYLrldnwEUMEOGaDoEC_aUmG85vPyXgyZL1lMWujLhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWIXhMGteeIZw_YfyI6Z-VcJ9i-5-D77th33ioqYVWDqQB233SbjuwdwNW3GZr2ocDYiadi_4hynK0BTSq__1QkY9KKCfOpwhYYTxwcIdi5_pm753aXJi1eYj53f1U94ranmCppulItd-C4CFOgXYLrldnwEUMEOGaDoEC_aUmG85vPyXgyZL1lMWujLhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjcPuWSCLbegWz_Fgnu4Noa3L1mefiAc0fgubupnmltDzkXGeRoG_NVKW31b6CUh9Y0DjgxiKEa3j44ryAuovuR4YtPFSce31eFlQdAtMO-qrSMTSy6AMhciegw5xUrAPN4NdCiNasGR1Bp3jsI_uqEOenAuvoC3jkh1CJp_ZpAYbtNy4hegTNqgy4C-h6f\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjcPuWSCLbegWz_Fgnu4Noa3L1mefiAc0fgubupnmltDzkXGeRoG_NVKW31b6CUh9Y0DjgxiKEa3j44ryAuovuR4YtPFSce31eFlQdAtMO-qrSMTSy6AMhciegw5xUrAPN4NdCiNasGR1Bp3jsI_uqEOenAuvoC3jkh1CJp_ZpAYbtNy4hegTNqgy4C-h6f=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">細漢ê時tsūn不時to有火車uì羅東載肖楠來製材所，輾tī鐵路邊ê柴埕，工人liam-mi就kā外皮剝--落-來，講是beh hōo柴箍khau風tsiah bē生蛀龜仔，縛柴箍ê草索仔，若tháu--落-來，仝款tàn tī柴埕，hām柴皮lām做一堆，suà手sak輕便車仔來載，總khîng來工場ê門喙囤。啊若豐原、東勢載--來ê松梧，iah是二水ê柳杉、福衫，mā是án-ne leh pìnn。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">50冬前用人leh拖ê pùn-sò車，有leh車人家厝無kài濟ê pùn-sò，m̄-koh in m̄肯載一大堆ê柴皮kah草索去倒，上纏--ê是tsia-ê beh hìnn掉ê pùn-sò lóng小可仔tâm-tâm，比鋸屑khah oh to̍h，無人beh khioh去起火，製材所無家己tshiâu-tshi̍k bē煞，kōo燒--ê是khah穩當ê步數。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">另外工人ē kā鋸--落-來看bē tsiūnn目ê柴頭柴尾做火母，ta--ê做下底先點hōo to̍h，tâm--ê tsiah疊頂kuân；也有放工去揣厝前後壁歹--去ê桌仔、椅仔、beh tàn掉ê pùn-sò，積hōo有夠tsiah做一改放火。Beh燒ê時tsūn，工人若無閒thang tī邊--a顧，to m̄管出日、落雨lóng據在伊去to̍h，沓沓仔燒、khuann-khuann仔薰，有閒tsiah倚來火堆邊小影--一-下，用柴枝ná pué、ná lā。無論按怎pìnn、按怎燒，決定bē去燒著厝前後壁，工人tiānn-tiānn講有火薰，厝內外khah無蠓蟲，無的確是tsit个緣故，大人tsiah ē hiah興。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">啊若未大ê囡仔phí就無仝--ah，in是愛sńg火koh驚hōo大人siam--著，ē bih tī橫橫ke̍h-ke̍h khah少人行跤到ê柴堆中ng，揣一搭hōo人看bē著火舌ê所在，四、五个人圍做伙引柴kue̍h仔hōo to̍h。拄著khah gia̍t-siâu</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">--ê，ē紮幾粒仔番薯來pû，是逐家上暢ê時tsūn。啊若掠ka-tsua̍h、niáu鼠來凌治、烘hōo死翹翹，mā是tsiânn tsia̍p leh pìnn ê齣頭。有tang時仔ē去hōo大人sa--著，耳仔根tsūn-tiâu-tiâu khiú tńg來到厝，若無食竹仔炒肉絲是無法度準煞--ê。M̄-koh，愛sńg火是胎帶（the-tuà）--ê，免人教to ē-hiáu ê代誌，大人按怎tia̍p，mā無彩手，隔tńg工仝款án-ne leh舞。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">大人透底mā用「sńg火ē偷tshuā尿」來教示阮tsia-ê囡仔。總--是講做你講，無人tsùn-būn--著，顛倒ē tī kha-tshng後gê講：「大人mā是愛sńg火koh……。In若bē tshuā尿，lán mā bē！」</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2129\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ=w448-h640\" width=\"448\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/